{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41356","headline":"北使还京作 · 冯道","name":"北使还京作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年今日奉皇华，只爲朝廷不爲家。\n殿上一杯天子泣，门前双节国人嗟。\n龙荒冬往时时雪，兔苑春归处处花。\n上下一行如骨肉，几人身死掩风沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}